        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the insurance for my bike calculated during the transit from Wagholi?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our full‑coverage transit insurance is IRDAI‑approved and based on the declared market value of the bike. The premium is a small percentage of that value and is included in the final quote. In the unlikely event of loss or damage, the policy reimburses 100% of the declared amount, ensuring complete financial protection.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What are the typical bike parcel train timings if I prefer rail over road?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Indian Railway schedules bike parcels on select express trains, usually departing in the early morning and arriving by late evening, with a transit time of 12‑16 hours for the Pune‑to‑Delhi corridor. However, exact timings vary daily, and you must coordinate with railway booking offices. For faster, door‑to‑door service, Bike Transportation In Wagholi by road remains the most reliable option.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is there a special rate for multiple bikes or corporate fleet relocation from Wagholi?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, Shree Ashirwad offers volume discounts for corporate clients and customers shipping more than one bike. The rate matrix considers total distance, number of bikes, and any additional services such as priority loading or extended insurance. Contact our sales team for a customized quote that reflects these savings.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the pre‑loading audit improve the safety of my bike during transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The pre‑loading audit is a systematic checklist performed by a trained supervisor before the bike enters the container. It verifies the bike’s condition, confirms proper crate dimensions, ensures all 7‑layer packaging steps are completed, and records any pre‑existing scratches. This audit creates a documented baseline, enabling immediate detection of any damage during transit and supporting insurance claims if needed.</p>
      </div>
